---@field importFromExternalOrderId? string DigiCert only. Use the certificate already issued in this DigiCert order, without reissuing it. Requires certificate.hsmKeyLabel to point at the certificate's private key on the HSM. The common name, validity and key algorithm come from that certificate, so commonName, certificateTtlDays and keyAlgorithm can't be sent with it.
