---@field offset? number The offset to start from. If you enter 10, it will start from the 10th certificate.
---@field limit? number The number of certificates to return.
---@field forPkiSync? boolean Retrieve only certificates available for PKI sync.
---@field search? string Search by SAN, CN, certificate ID, or serial number.
---@field status? string Comma-separated list of certificate statuses to filter by. Supported values are active, renewed, expired, revoked and deleted. A certificate superseded by a renewal matches renewed rather than active until it expires or is revoked. Deleted certificates match only deleted.
---@field includeDeleted? boolean Include deleted certificates in the results when no status filter is set. Deleted certificates are excluded by default.
---@field profileIds? infisical.SearchProjectCertificatesRequestProfileIdsList Filter by certificate profile IDs.
---@field fromDate? string Filter certificates created from this date.
---@field toDate? string Filter certificates created until this date.
---@field metadata? infisical.SearchProjectCertificatesRequestMetadataList Filter by metadata key-value pairs. Each entry should have a key (required) and optionally a value to match against.
---@field extendedKeyUsage? string Filter by extended key usage. Only certificates containing this EKU will be returned (e.g. 'codeSigning', 'serverAuth').
---@field keyAlgorithm? infisical.SearchProjectCertificatesRequestKeyAlgorithm Filter by key algorithm (e.g. 'RSA_2048', 'EC_prime256v1').
---@field signatureAlgorithm? string Filter by signature algorithm (e.g. 'RSA-SHA256', 'ECDSA-SHA256').
---@field keySizes? infisical.SearchProjectCertificatesRequestKeySizesList Filter by key sizes in bits (e.g. [2048, 4096]).
---@field caIds? infisical.SearchProjectCertificatesRequestCaIdsList Filter by certificate authority IDs.
---@field enrollmentTypes? infisical.SearchProjectCertificatesRequestEnrollmentTypesList Filter by enrollment types (e.g. 'api', 'est', 'acme', 'scep').
---@field source? infisical.SearchProjectCertificatesRequestSource Filter by certificate source ('issued', 'discovered', 'imported').
---@field notAfterFrom? string Filter certificates expiring on or after this date.
---@field notAfterTo? string Filter certificates expiring on or before this date.
---@field notBeforeFrom? string Filter certificates issued on or after this date.
---@field notBeforeTo? string Filter certificates issued on or before this date.
---@field applicationId? string Filter to certificates issued through a specific Application.
---@field applicationIds? infisical.SearchProjectCertificatesRequestApplicationIdsList Filter to certificates issued through any of the supplied Applications.
---@field sortBy? infisical.SearchProjectCertificatesRequestSortBy|string Column to sort by (e.g. 'notAfter', 'notBefore', 'commonName').
