---@field scriptId string The ID of the Cloudflare Workers script to sync secrets to.
---@field variableType? infisical.UpdateCloudflareWorkersSecretSyncRequestDestinationConfigVariableType|string The type of variable to sync secrets as: secret_text (default), plain_text or json. If a secret already exists on the Worker as a different type, the sync fails and nothing is changed, except that with syncNonSecretBindings on, a secret_text sync updates existing plaintext and JSON variables as they are. Syncs created before this option existed have no type and skip those secrets instead. Infisical only deletes variables of this type.

