---@field eabHmacKey? string The External Account Binding (EAB) HMAC key for the ACME Certificate Authority. Required if the ACME provider uses EAB.
---@field dnsResolver? any An optional custom DNS resolver IP address to use for verifying DNS propagation during ACME challenges. Must be a valid IP address (e.g. 8.8.8.8). When not set, the system default DNS resolver is used.

